      <a href="/article/1415" hreflang="zh-hans">Postdoctoral Researcher Recruitment </a>
    </div>
                  <div class="desc three-line">Postdoctoral Researcher RecruitmentAbout AIRSFounded in 2019 through a partnership between the Shenzhen Municipal Government and The Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen (CUHK-Shenzhen), AIRS is dedicated to fundamental and applied research in artificial intelligence and robotics. The institute drives technological translation across healthcare, intelligent manufacturing, urban services, and sustainable development, while cultivating world-class research talent and delivering impact for industry and society.AI + Robotics for SocietyAIRS currently has three main research directions:&nbsp;Multi-Scale Intraluminal Interventional Surgical Robots for Human HealthLeveraging flexible body and micro/nano-robot technologies with multi-modal image navigation for minimally invasive diagnosis and treatment of respiratory, cerebrovascular, and oncological diseases.&nbsp;Heterogeneous Multi-Robot Collaboration Systems for Urban Health ServicesDeveloping heterogeneous robot swarm systems for…</div>
